{"id":"eed9e6920706b864","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-smullyan-pa-semantic-incompleteness.md","title":"The Book’s Semantic Incompleteness Proof for P.A.","display":"thm-smullyan-pa-semantic-incompleteness — The Book’s Semantic Incompleteness Proof for P.A.","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-smullyan-pa-semantic-incompleteness","aliases":["92-thm-smullyan-pa-semantic-incompleteness"],"display":"thm-smullyan-pa-semantic-incompleteness — The Book’s Semantic Incompleteness Proof for P.A.","source":"第 IV 章 pp. 48–50，Theorem I（PDF 65–67）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-thm-smullyan-syntax-arithmetization]]","[[92-cor-smullyan-diagonal-closure]]","[[92-thm-smullyan-correctness]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-smullyan-pa-semantic-incompleteness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-smullyan-pa-semantic-incompleteness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-smullyan-pa-semantic-incompleteness — The Book’s Semantic Incompleteness Proof for P.A."},{"key":"source","html":"第 IV 章 pp. 48–50，Theorem I（PDF 65–67）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c056f7fa0375bc62\" href=\"?note=c056f7fa0375bc62\" title=\"92-thm-smullyan-syntax-arithmetization\">92-thm-smullyan-syntax-arithmetization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e095d63f890051fd\" href=\"?note=e095d63f890051fd\" title=\"92-cor-smullyan-diagonal-closure\">92-cor-smullyan-diagonal-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"678e4ae13575ec1c\" href=\"?note=678e4ae13575ec1c\" title=\"92-thm-smullyan-correctness\">92-thm-smullyan-correctness</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=P_{\\mathrm{PA}_A}^{\\#}\">\\(P=P_{\\mathrm{PA}_A}^{\\#}\\)</span> 为原书 P.A. 的定理码集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_E,W_E\">\\(d_E,W_E\\)</span> 为包裹对角化。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{True}_E\">\\(\\operatorname{True}_E\\)</span> 为标准句子真值；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_A\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_A\\)</span> 是无指数句子集。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}pa\\text{-}semantic\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\\quad\n\\exists X\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_A\\;\n[\\operatorname{True}_E(X)\\land\\mathrm{PA}_A\\nvdash X\\land\\mathrm{PA}_A\\nvdash\\neg_E X].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}pa\\text{-}semantic\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\\quad\n\\exists X\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_A\\;\n[\\operatorname{True}_E(X)\\land\\mathrm{PA}_A\\nvdash X\\land\\mathrm{PA}_A\\nvdash\\neg_E X].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>P 是算术集，所以补集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\\setminus P\">\\(\\mathbb N\\setminus P\\)</span> 也是算术集；对角原像闭包给一个无指数公式 H 表达 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_E^{-1}[\\mathbb N\\setminus P]\">\\(d_E^{-1}[\\mathbb N\\setminus P]\\)</span>。先使其唯一可能自由变量为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_1^E\">\\(v_1^E\\)</span>。设 h=<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_E(H)\">\\(g_E(H)\\)</span>、X=<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_E(H,h)\">\\(W_E(H,h)\\)</span>，则 X 的码是 d(h)，且 X 真 iff d(h)∉P，即 X 真 iff P.A. 不证明 X。</p>\n<p>若 P.A. 证明 X，正确性使 X 真，与这个双条件矛盾；所以 X 未被证明，而双条件给 X 真。其否定是假句，正确性再次排除它的证明。此路线明确使用标准正确性；不是仅在任意系统普通相容下套用语义证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-thm-smullyan-syntax-arithmetization","status":"resolved","id":"c056f7fa0375bc62","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-smullyan-syntax-arithmetization]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-cor-smullyan-diagonal-closure","status":"resolved","id":"e095d63f890051fd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-cor-smullyan-diagonal-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-smullyan-correctness","status":"resolved","id":"678e4ae13575ec1c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-smullyan-correctness]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P=P_{\\mathrm{PA}_A}^{\\#}","display":false},{"tex":"d_E,W_E","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{True}_E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}pa\\text{-}semantic\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\\quad\n\\exists X\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_A\\;\n[\\operatorname{True}_E(X)\\land\\mathrm{PA}_A\\nvdash X\\land\\mathrm{PA}_A\\nvdash\\neg_E X].","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb N\\setminus P","display":false},{"tex":"d_E^{-1}[\\mathbb N\\setminus P]","display":false},{"tex":"v_1^E","display":false},{"tex":"g_E(H)","display":false},{"tex":"W_E(H,h)","display":false}],"bytes":1666,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-42","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-beta-function]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-beta-coding]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-exponent-sigma1]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-sigma-collapse]] → [[92-cor-smullyan-diagonal-closure]]、[[92-thm-smullyan-exponent-elimination]]、[[92-thm-smullyan-syntax-arithmetization]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-pa-semantic-incompleteness]]。"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-312","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-smullyan-pa-semantic-incompleteness]]"}],"outgoing":["c056f7fa0375bc62","e095d63f890051fd","678e4ae13575ec1c"]}